Z||000002||2M4 Dale||05-23-2000||11:59 PM||||I just installed the RS Motorsports box in my car. It sounds GREAT !!! The box was very pricey but I love the look. The sealed box has .4 cubic feet of space so you'll need a low Q woofer. I used a Power Accoustic 8" powered up by a Pheonix Gold Saphire 35w per amp. I don't remember the series of the speaker but it uses a geodesic dome style cone and has a 55oz. magnet.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Patrick's Dad||05-24-2000||12:12 AM||||Damn.<P>I have a good idea of what that'll do to your brain, but what will a 55 oz. magnet do to the ECM?||||reg||1
Z||000004||billfredmike24||05-24-2000||01:26 AM||||2m4 dale - do you have any pics of yours..  Is your car standard or automatic, does it get in your way when shifting.<BR>I checked out there sight and it says $350, did this include the box and the speaker or did you have to buy anything extra.  Did they use your console and modify it or did it come as one piece, and did you install it yourself.<P><p>[This message has been edited by billfredmike24 (edited 05-24-2000).]||||reg||10
Z||000005||2M4 Dale||05-24-2000||06:35 AM||||Patrick's Dad, I was worried about the ECM but so far so good.<P>BFM24, The box was $190.00 US including shipping and my old center console as a core. The speaker shown in the RS Mototrsports pic is a Kicker. Now thats a good speaker but I don't think it's that good...Go out and buy your own. The install was as easy as changing the console in and out...no problems. You may have to trim some material from around the speaker hole and you have to pre-drill the holes for mounting your speaker. (A cordless drill and a fine point magic marker works wonders) And yes I did it myself. Stillofknight helped me with the wiring. For a complete seal you'll need to get a small tube of silicone to seal the hole for the speaker wire.<P>I'm 5'10", my car is a 5spd. and I notice no difference at all in elbow room. The box adds about 2 inches to the depth of the center console. I'll see if I can't take a pic and post it later today. <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/002117.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/002117.html</A> <BR>here's the earlier string about this box. Some like it some don't...it is expensive I guess. <P>[This message has been edited by 2M4 Dale (edited 05-24-2000).]<p>[This message has been edited by 2M4 Dale (edited 05-24-2000).]||||reg||1
